<title>USA: Banc One to buy First USA - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Banc One to buy First USA - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banc One Corp is expected to announce today that it has an agreement to buy First USA Inc for about $7 billion, according to people familiar with the deal, the Wall Street Journal reported Monday.</p>
<p>Banc One is offering about $52 for each First USA share, the Journal said.</p>
<p>The newspaper said executives of both companies have gathered in New York for a presentation to analysts scheduled Monday morning.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
